inet won't look after me "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["anymore, but there will always be more "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["ways to feed out there...more men to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["feed me. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 5", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Screw this place! I'm hungry now!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And I'm not sucking off a horse! "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I've got standards..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [-1, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 2, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 2, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [180]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Pharaoh1215", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You head out into the harsh desert sun, away from "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the safety and luxury of the pyramid, determined "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to be tied down no longer by Farinet's will."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [240]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Pharaoh1105", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["As time goes by legends are formed of the alluring "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["fiend who walks the sands. A demon in human form "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["that drains the men who encounter her like a "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["succubus and leaves the women yearning for more."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Pharaoh447", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Though Farinet's rule stretches throughout the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["desert and beyond the demon of the sands is "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["never captured, somehow always evading "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["those sent after her."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Pharaoh1112", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Most agree she just outwits and seduces the men "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["who chase her, but the occasional rumour arises "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["that Pharaoh Farinet deliberately lets the woman "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["run wild out of pure amusement..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 2, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": [""]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{  Ending E46 - Succubus of the Sands"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 121, "parameters": [1097, 1097, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 355, "parameters": ["global_save"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 353, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 0, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "", "charact